{"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Migrating from NavigationStack","modules":[{"name":"SwiftRouting"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting"]]},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app already uses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink"},{"type":"text","text":", or native sheet\/cover modifiers, you can migrate to SwiftRouting incrementally. This guide walks through each common pattern and shows the equivalent SwiftRouting code."}]},{"text":"NavigationStack → RoutingView","anchor":"NavigationStack-%E2%86%92-RoutingView","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Before","anchor":"Before","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@State private var path = NavigationPath()","","var body: some View {","    NavigationStack(path: $path) {","        HomeView()","            .navigationDestination(for: String.self) { value in","                if value == \"detail\" {","                    DetailView()","                } else if value == \"settings\" {","                    SettingsView()","                }","            }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After","anchor":"After","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Define your routes as a Swift enum, then replace the stack with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RoutingView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["enum HomeRoute: Route {","    case home","    case detail(id: Int)","    case settings","","    var name: String {","        switch self {","        case .home: \"home\"","        case .detail(let id): \"detail(\\(id))\"","        case .settings: \"settings\"","        }","    }","}","","extension HomeRoute: RouteDestination {","    static func view(for route: HomeRoute) -> some View {","        switch route {","        case .home: HomeView()","        case .detail(let id): DetailView(id: id)","        case .settings: SettingsView()","        }","    }","}","","var body: some View {","    RoutingView(destination: HomeRoute.self, root: .home)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"navigationDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" registrations are replaced by a single "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RouteDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" conformance."}]},{"text":"NavigationLink → router.push","anchor":"NavigationLink-%E2%86%92-routerpush","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Before","anchor":"Before","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["NavigationLink(\"View Details\", value: \"detail\")","","\/\/ Or with a destination view","NavigationLink(\"View Details\") {","    DetailView(id: 42)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After","anchor":"After","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"router.push(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or the SwiftRouting "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink(route:)"},{"type":"text","text":" extension:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Programmatic push","Button(\"View Details\") {","    router.push(HomeRoute.detail(id: 42))","}","","\/\/ Declarative NavigationLink","NavigationLink(\"View Details\", route: HomeRoute.detail(id: 42))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationLink(route:)"},{"type":"text","text":" performs push navigation only. For modal presentation, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"router.present(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"router.cover(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important","type":"aside"},{"text":"Sheets → router.present","anchor":"Sheets-%E2%86%92-routerpresent","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Before","anchor":"Before","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@State private var showSettings = false","","var body: some View {","    Button(\"Open Settings\") {","        showSettings = true","    }","    .sheet(isPresented: $showSettings) {","        SettingsView()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After","anchor":"After","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@Environment(\\.router) private var router","","Button(\"Open Settings\") {","    router.present(HomeRoute.settings)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you need sheet presentation modifiers such as "},{"code":"presentationDetents","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", present without a navigation stack:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ In your route definition","var routingType: RoutingType { .sheet(withStack: false) }","","\/\/ Or inline","router.present(HomeRoute.settings, withStack: false)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Full-Screen Cover → router.cover","anchor":"Full-Screen-Cover-%E2%86%92-routercover","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Before","anchor":"Before","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@State private var showOnboarding = false","","var body: some View {","    Button(\"Start Onboarding\") {","        showOnboarding = true","    }","    .fullScreenCover(isPresented: $showOnboarding) {","        OnboardingView()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After","anchor":"After","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["Button(\"Start Onboarding\") {","    router.cover(HomeRoute.onboarding)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"TabView → RoutingTabView","anchor":"TabView-%E2%86%92-RoutingTabView","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Before","anchor":"Before","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@State private var selectedTab = 0","","TabView(selection: $selectedTab) {","    HomeView()","        .tabItem { Label(\"Home\", systemImage: \"house\") }","        .tag(0)","","    SearchView()","        .tabItem { Label(\"Search\", systemImage: \"magnifyingglass\") }","        .tag(1)","","    ProfileView()","        .tabItem { Label(\"Profile\", systemImage: \"person\") }","        .tag(2)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After — Option 1: RoutingTabView (recommended)","anchor":"After-Option-1-RoutingTabView-recommended","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"RoutingTabView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when you need programmatic cross-tab navigation via ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/TabRouter","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["enum HomeTab: TabRoute {","    case home","    case search","    case profile","","    var name: String {","        switch self {","        case .home: \"home\"","        case .search: \"search\"","        case .profile: \"profile\"","        }","    }","}","","struct ContentView: View {","    @State private var selectedTab: HomeTab = .home","","    var body: some View {","        RoutingTabView(tab: $selectedTab, destination: HomeRoute.self) { destination in","            RoutingView(tab: .home, destination: destination, root: .home)","                .tabItem { Label(\"Home\", systemImage: \"house\") }","","            RoutingView(tab: .search, destination: destination, root: .search)","                .tabItem { Label(\"Search\", systemImage: \"magnifyingglass\") }","","            RoutingView(tab: .profile, destination: destination, root: .profile)","                .tabItem { Label(\"Profile\", systemImage: \"person\") }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After — Option 2: Native TabView with .tabToRoot","anchor":"After-Option-2-Native-TabView-with-tabToRoot","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For simpler cases without programmatic tab control:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct ContentView: View {","    @Environment(\\.router) private var router","    @State private var selectedTab: HomeTab = .home","","    var body: some View {","        TabView(selection: .tabToRoot(for: $selectedTab, in: router)) {","            RoutingView(tab: .home, destination: HomeRoute.self, root: .home)","                .tabItem { Label(\"Home\", systemImage: \"house\") }","","            RoutingView(tab: .search, destination: HomeRoute.self, root: .search)","                .tabItem { Label(\"Search\", systemImage: \"magnifyingglass\") }","","            RoutingView(tab: .profile, destination: HomeRoute.self, root: .profile)","                .tabItem { Label(\"Profile\", systemImage: \"person\") }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tabToRoot"},{"type":"text","text":" binding automatically pops to root when the user taps the already-selected tab."}]},{"name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This option does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" provide "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Environment(\\.tabRouter)"},{"type":"text","text":". Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RoutingTabView"},{"type":"text","text":" when cross-tab programmatic navigation is needed."}]}],"style":"important","type":"aside"},{"text":"Deep Links","anchor":"Deep-Links","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Before","anchor":"Before","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deep link handling typically required parsing URLs and manually mutating "},{"code":"NavigationPath","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":[".onOpenURL { url in","    if url.path == \"\/detail\" {","        path.append(\"detail\")","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"After","anchor":"After","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Define a typed identifier enum (","type":"text"},{"code":"Hashable & Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") to represent your deep link inputs, then implement ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/DeeplinkHandler","type":"reference"},{"text":" to map it to a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/DeeplinkRoute","type":"reference"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["enum AppDeeplinkIdentifier: Hashable, Sendable {","    case detail(id: Int)","}","","extension AppDeeplinkIdentifier {","    init?(url: URL) {","        switch url.path {","        case \"\/detail\":","            guard let id = Int(url.lastPathComponent) else { return nil }","            self = .detail(id: id)","        default:","            return nil","        }","    }","}","","struct HomeDeeplinkHandler: DeeplinkHandler {","    typealias R = AppDeeplinkIdentifier","    typealias D = HomeRoute","","    func deeplink(from route: AppDeeplinkIdentifier) async throws -> DeeplinkRoute<HomeRoute>? {","        switch route {","        case .detail(let id):","            return .push(.detail(id: id))","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Parse the URL into the identifier inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":", then pass it to the handler:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct HomeRootView: View {","    @Environment(\\.router) private var router","    let handler = HomeDeeplinkHandler()","","    var body: so